    "Details": "The Royal Hermes introduced in 2740 has an upgraded weapon suite with four medium lasers and one small laser in addition to the flamer. It also mounts a Beagle active probe and MASC motive system. Room for these improvements were made possible by switching to an XL engine, and as usual with Royal 'Mechs, it also uses double heat sinks.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Improved Communications</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.01</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limit: Left Lower</color>",
